Primedia, Africa&#x2019;s leading producer and distributor of television content, has acquired The Africa Channel , one of the few Black-owned U.S. media companies dedicated to creating content for African audiences.

The deal combines The Africa Channel's Los Angeles-based media businesses with Primedia&#x2019;s media content production, advertiser relationships and distribution capabilities across the continent of Africa. Related Stories Nike Drops New Air Jordan 11 Retro 'Green Screen' Sneakers: Here’s Where To Buy a Pair Online Here's How to Watch WWE Crown Jewel 2026 Live Online

Primedia plans to invest in TAC&#x2019;s next phase of growth by expanding worldwide distribution of its linear, FAST and digital services, increasing development and production of original content and building a broader global media brand for audiences of African content around the world. The pact gives Primedia its first owned-and-operated U.S. television network and streaming platform outside of Africa. blogherads.adq.push(function () { blogherads .defineSlot( 'medrec', 'gpt-variety-article-mid-article-uid0' ) .setTargeting( 'pos', ["mid-article1","mid-articleX","mid","mid-article"] ) .setTargeting( 'viewable', 'yes' ) .setSubAdUnitPath("ros\/mid-article") .addSize([[300,250],[2,2],[300,251],[2,4],[4,2],[320,480],[620,366],[300,450]]) .setClsOptimization("minsize") ; });

TAC&#x2019;s media assets being acquired include Demand Africa, a streaming platform available as an SVOD/AVOD app, as well as a free, ad-supported streaming television (FAST) channel; TAC Studios, the in-house studio that develops and produces original content; TAC Labs, an AI-driven innovation team that has developed projects for the entertainment and media market with plans to collaborate with Primedia.

&#x201C;The combination of Primedia&#x2019;s talent pool and the brilliant team at The Africa Channel brings together an established U.S. platform with Primedia&#x2019;s tech stack, production, commercial and distribution strength,&#x201D; Jonathan Procter, group CEO of Primedia, said. &#x201C;Together, we intend to build a business that can move African news, sports, content, talent and brands more effectively between continents while creating new opportunities across distribution, advertising and content ownership.&#x201D; blogherads.adq.push(function () { blogherads .defineSlot( 'medrec', 'gpt-dsk-tab-mid-article2-uid1' ) .setTargeting( 'pos', ["mid","mid-article2","mid-articleX"] ) .setTargeting( 'viewable', 'yes' ) .setSubAdUnitPath("ros\/mid-article2") .addSize([[320,480],[300,250],[300,251],[2,4],[4,2],[620,366],[300,450]]) .setClsOptimization("minsize") ; });

Paula Williams Madison, currently TAC's principal owner, will become the chair of the advisory board. Through TAC, Madison has ranked among the top leaders in Black-owned media, a segue she made after a long run as a senior executive at NBCUniversal. Narendra Reddy, the current chief operating officer of TAC, will become chief executive officer of TAC and president of Primedia Studios. Nikos Tziotis has been named president of Primedia USA and he will handle global distribution efforts for TAC.

&#x201C;When we launched The Africa Channel more than two decades ago, the idea was simple but ambitious: Africa deserved to be seen through a broader and more authentic lens and there was a global audience seeking that connection,&#x201D; Madison said. &#x201C;Primedia gives TAC the resources to take that mission to a new scale &#x2014; with more programming, more platforms and more international reach. I look forward to remaining closely involved with Jonathan, Nikosand Narendra as we build the next chapter.&#x201D;

Reddy's appointment as CEO is designed to ensure consistency at the firm as the ownership changes hands.

&#x201C;For 21 years, The Africa Channel has demonstrated the demand for compelling stories from Africa and the global diaspora,&#x201D; Reddy said. &#x201C;For distributors, advertisers and creators, our goal is to build an increasingly valuable bridge between Africa and global audiences. Our ambition is not simply to operate another television channel. It is to build a modern global media company around creativity from Africa and the increasingly interconnected diaspora.&#x201D;

(Pictured: Paula Madison , Narendra Reddy and Nikos Tziotis)

EXCLUSIVE: A new, as-yet-untitled stage musical inspired by the life of groundbreaking artist Frida Kahlo is in development, with director Diane Paulus ( Jagged Little Pill, Waitress , the upcoming Rhinoceros ) leading a creative team that also includes Mexican playwright Georgina Escobar (book) and Latin Grammy Award-winning Mexican singer-songwriter Silvana Estrada (score).

The musical will be produced by American Repertory Theater (A.R.T.), the Tony-winning Cambridge regional theater at Harvard University that has launched such Broadway musical transfers as Pippin (2014), Finding Neverland (2015), Waitress (2016) and Real Women Have Curves ( 2023 ), among numerous others. blogherads.adq.push(function () { blogherads .defineSlot( 'medrec', 'gpt-dsk-tab-mid-article1-uid0' ) .setTargeting( 'pos', ["mid-article1","mid","mid-articleX","mid-article","300x251"] ) .setTargeting( 'viewable', 'yes' ) .setSubAdUnitPath("ros\/mid-article") .addSize([[2,2],[300,250],[620,350],[300,251],[501,282],[3,3],[2,4],[4,2],[620,366]]) .exemptFromSleep() .setClsOptimization("minsize") ; }); Related Stories News 'Much Ado About Nothing' With Tom Hiddleston & Hayley Atwell Takes Hefty $2.4M; Billy Crystal's '860' Breaks House Record - Broadway Box Office News Broadway's Seaview Taps New York-Based Exec & Former Clinton Non-Profit Advisor Justin Klein As COO; Ups Anna Mack Pardee

Additional creative team members, and other information about the project including a production timeline will be announced at a later date. The stage work has the full support of Kahlo's family and living heirs. Watch on Deadline if ( !window.pmc.harmony?.isEventAdScheduledTime() ) { pmcCnx.cmd.push(function() { pmcCnx({ settings: { plugins: { pmcAtlasMG: { iabPlcmt: 2, } } }, playerId: '32fe25c4-79aa-406a-af44-69b41e969e71', playlistId: '0199e506-e642-7728-8264-463efe71337b', }).render("connatix_contextual_player_div"); }); } else { // This should only be get called when page cache is not cleared and it's event time. window.pmc.harmony?.switchToHarmonyPlayer(); }

In a statement, Paulus, who is the Terrie and Bradley Bloom Artistic Director of A.R.T., said, &#x201C;I am deeply inspired by Frida Kahlo&#x2019;s resilience, passion, and creativity and I am thrilled to be working with Georgina and Silvana to explore the life of this extraordinary artist as a new musical. As we develop this project in the US and Mexico, I am especially grateful to the Kahlo Estate for their partnership in giving us access to primary sources that have inspired our creative process.&#x201D;

Speaking on behalf of the Kahlo Family, Mara Romeo Kahlo, universal heiress to the Frida Kahlo legacy, said, &#x201C;Frida has been mythologized since she first entered the public consciousness, and my daughters and I have made it our mission to present the world with the Frida known only to her intimates. That is why we created the Museo Casa Kahlo in my childhood home, and it&#x2019;s why I am so excited by Diane, Georgina and Silvana&#x2019;s vision for musicalizing her story.&#x201D;

Escobar's book will be a bilingual, impressionistic take on the seminal artist. blogherads.adq.push(function () { blogherads .defineSlot( 'medrec', 'gpt-dl-mid-article-inject2-uid1' ) .setTargeting( 'pos', ["mid-article2","mid-articleX","mid-article","mid","300x251"] ) .setTargeting( 'viewable', 'yes' ) .setSubAdUnitPath("ros\/mid-article2") .addSize([[300,250],[300,251],[620,350],[2,4],[4,2],[620,366]]) .exemptFromSleep() .setClsOptimization("minsize") ; });

