&#x201C; Grendel has been at the forefront of independent comics for over forty years, and we&#x2019;re thrilled to bring Matt Wagner&#x2019;s creation to Netflix,&#x201D; said John Derderian, Netflix's VP, Animation Series + Kids & Family TV. &#x201C;Like the comic, this animated series will break the traditional superhero mold just as Matt's time-honored comic book has always done. Bobak, Dark Horse Entertainment and Bobbypills are bold storytellers who love this world as much as its fans do, and we&#x2019;re so excited to partner with them to bring this story to screen.&#x201D;

Originally published in 1982 by Comico, Grendel was moved to Dark Horse following the indie label's bankruptcy by Wagner who owned the character. Wagner is also known for creating the Mage comic book series and his work for DC Comics.

Esfarjani most recently served as a consulting producer on Season 1 of Apple TV's Widow's Bay, sharing in its Emmy win for Outstanding Comedy Series.

&#x201C;Being able to bring a character as iconic as Grendel to life has been a true thrill,&#x201D; he said. &#x201C;Having the support of Matt Wagner, my great EPs, and the awesome team of Netflix, has made it all the more exciting, and partnering with Bobbypills Studio has made it all a true joy.&#x201D;

